WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:01.980
Ramen Supreme King

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:01.980
<b>Supreme King</b>

00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:06.230
<b>Episode 16: Yukimachi and Subaru</b>

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.230
Hey, welcome.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:07.980
Oh.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:08.880
Oh.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.430
You come here often?

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:13.150
About once a week.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.620
Eating at a ramen shop 
by yourself is kind of cool.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.530
I came because my mom 
said she's working late.

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:21.720
Hey, welcome.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:22.200
Hmm?

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:23.660
Oh.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.000
Hey.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:25.620
Hey.

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:28.030
H-Hello.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.620
<i>What is this grouping?</i>

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.450
You look like you're enjoying it.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.860
Y-Yeah, I guess?

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:45.640
Taiyou, this is a good opportunity, 
so why not try asking?

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:47.240
Hmm? Mm...

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:48.100
Ask what?

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:48.860
Hmm?

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:54.700
Uh, about the wish for our Knight's Pact.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:56.280
The wish?

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:58.880
I haven't used mine yet,

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:02.370
so I was wondering what 
everyone used theirs for.

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.770
Mine's a secret.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.670
Oh, if you don't want to answer...

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:11.500
Yuuhi, tell him.

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:14.760
I had my grandfather's illness cured.

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:38.500
<i>When I looked up, 
that sky was full of wonders.</i>

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:43.800
<i>The despair I bottled up tormented me,</i>

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:47.770
<i>and I wanted the courage 
to break my chains of isolation.</i>

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:49.040
<i>(You are my light)</i>

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:54.630
<i>I was searching for your 
brilliant light in my hazy dreams</i>

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:58.930
<i>to kick away the limits placed on myself.</i>

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:03.890
<i>Now with your courage, 
let’s soar into the sky.</i>

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:06.600
<i>Let's CRUSH the fear!</i>

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:11.740
<i>I swear to you, at the ends 
of this chaotic world,</i>

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:14.280
<i>that even if you fall, I'll</i>

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:16.830
<i>Be the HERO!</i>

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:22.010
<i>I'll be waiting at the future 
we're moving toward,</i>

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:25.900
<i>with a “YES, MY LORD!” 
for your constant radiance,</i>

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:29.850
<i>clutching the stars raining down upon us.</i>

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:37.590
<i>I'll love you until we reach 
that future you want to destroy.</i>

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:53.980
Yuki!

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:56.270
You made a big mess again!

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.780
You don't feel bad about it at all.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:02.960
Even though I'm cleaning it 
for you every week, jeez.

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:05.140
Sorry, Subaru-chan.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.250
I know we live in the same 
apartment complex,

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:09.660
but you're relying on me too much, jeez.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:12.100
I went out and had ramen.

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:15.410
At the same place Samidare-san 
and Shimaki-san went to.

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:17.680
Oh? Tell me you're going next time.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:18.490
Sure.

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:21.380
That should do it, I think.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.890
Thanks.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:26.130
I'll come by again, 
but stop making it so messy.

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:28.100
No promises, but sure!

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.260
There you go being vague again!

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:32.560
Owie, sowwy!

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:35.270
Tsukishiro

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:34.090
Later.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:35.270
Subaru-chan...

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:36.230
Hm?

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:38.570
You'll make a good wife.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:40.880
Wh-What are you saying?

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:43.660
I feel the same way, but I won't 
let Mikazuki have her!

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:45.980
Shut up, Ly!

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:48.740
Those two get along so well.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:56.000
Yukimachi.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.040
What?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.610
Why not join a local dojo or a club?

00:04:00.610 --> 00:04:05.440
I was thinking about joining one, 
once this battle's over and I have free time.

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:11.270
If you get too strong, I wonder 
if Mikazuki will come after you.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:16.100
If he does, then we'll fight 
over Subaru-chan.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:20.820
Speaking of her, I wonder 
what Subaru wished for.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:23.200
I haven't been able to ask because 
it would be too embarrassing

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.090
if she asked what mine was.

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:32.140
<i>Shimaki-san, Amamiya-san, and Subaru-chan 
will handle the thinking for me.</i>

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:34.000
<i>What I need to do</i>

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.540
<i>is get stronger!</i>

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.500
<i>And protect Subaru-chan!</i>

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.550
<b>Early April</b>

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:44.760
Good morning.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.450
I am the Turtle Knight, Long Yue.

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:49.720
The Earth is currently in danger.

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:55.170
As the Turtle Knight, we must 
work together with our allies

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:56.890
to defeat the mage!

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:01.570
A talking turtle! Master and 
Subaru-chan will be shocked!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:02.820
Cluck-cluck!

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:06.470
Listen to me! Right now the Earth—cluck!

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:08.780
Hey! Stop struggling!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:10.420
Good morning.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.490
Hoshikawa

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.320
Good morning.

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:13.120
Cluck-hey!

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:14.830
Nice to meet you.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:18.080
I've been waiting for you two 
to arrive for a long time.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:22.050
It's a pleasure, Ly Soleil-kun, 
Long Yue-kun.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:25.920
Hey! How can you see us 
when you're not even a knight?!

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:27.540
And how do you know our names?!

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.260
Oh, did we ever introduce ourselves?

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:34.100
I'll soon be the Swordfish's Knight.

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:36.310
People call me Master.

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:39.050
If you're Zan's partner, then that's that.

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:40.910
He always chooses weirdos.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:44.340
Master, what are these?

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:45.610
Turtle, turtle!

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:48.220
For now, you should try and listen to them.

00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:50.570
They're not lying to you.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.290
That's right! Listen up!

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:56.120
Yuki, do you believe them?

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:59.630
Master said they're not lying, 
so I believe them.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.660
That's right! We're not lying!

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:04.090
But it's so outrageous.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:09.090
It's not as far-fetched as a Master 
who can do anything and knows everything.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:10.000
Well...

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:12.180
Who on earth is that man, anyway?

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:14.560
Master is Master.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.060
A wish?!

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:18.980
It's better to use it early.

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:21.150
You never know when you might die.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:24.270
Hmm, can you even do anything?

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:26.490
Ah, you don't believe me, do you?!

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:27.850
Hmm.

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:31.700
You can wish for anything. 
Even money or health.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:36.460
Hmm...

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:38.670
Nothing quite comes to mind.

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:41.830
Is it possible to wish 
for someone's happiness?

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:44.790
Hmm. Meaning...

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:50.300
have their brain constantly produce 
the hormone causing euphoria?

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.890
No! Not that.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:56.940
You mean making them more likely 
to receive good fortune,

00:06:56.940 --> 00:07:00.310
less likely to get sick, and more likely 
to be surrounded by smiles...

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.100
then I can do that.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.060
Yeah, that's good.

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:06.400
Yeah, I have it.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.990
Then proclaim your wish.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:11.870
I wish for Yuki...

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:13.760
I wish for Subaru-chan...

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:16.920
...to be happy!

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:25.620
What are you grinning about?

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:26.880
It's a secret.

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:29.420
Were you thinking about Mikazuki?

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:31.260
Dummy! I wasn't!

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:37.810
Taiyou, you've been even moodier 
than usual since yesterday.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:39.710
It's nothing.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:41.350
Wha?!

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:47.520
<b>Legendary Mushrooms</b>

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:47.520
<b>Black Beach</b>

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:50.830
Pyanepsion?

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:52.660
I thought they were all destroyed.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:55.160
I told you they were scary.

00:07:58.780 --> 00:07:59.710
Taiyou!

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:00.860
I know.

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:02.460
Let's get away from here first.

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:12.400
I can't believe it's these things again.

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:14.840
Did one get away from us?

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:21.930
Holding Field:

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.600
Myriad Headed Orochi!

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.940
Unstoppable Spear!

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:27.580
Halberd!

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:30.700
Holding Field: Kusakabe!

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:36.600
They're still as weak as ever.

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.450
But there's no end to them.

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:45.700
I'm here!

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:46.420
Princess!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.130
Samidare Punch!

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:49.840
Samidare Kick!

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:52.880
So fast!

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.350
Shimaki-san's golem!

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:07.200
This is kind of exhilarating.

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:13.560
We didn't let any escape, right?

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:15.110
Not that could I see.

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:18.820
With as many as there were, 
we couldn't stop a few from escaping.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.930
That may be true,

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:23.640
but without any other ideas 
on how to defeat them,

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:24.870
we'll just have to be thorough.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:29.940
Hm? What's the matter, Asahina?

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:33.770
It felt like they were 
a little tougher than last time.

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:46.440
<b>Some Shopping District</b>

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:48.340
Hey, Yuuhi.

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:49.250
What?

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.580
What are you going to do about that?

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:52.770
About what?

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:58.780
Back when you were leaving after fighting 
Hakudou to class-change to Invincible...

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:02.500
I love you.

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:07.340
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.280
I was passed out back then.

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:13.140
Oh, you don't need to bother 
telling me what happened.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.500
I'm not interested.

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:16.930
<i>This lame four-eyes!</i>

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:19.300
<i>He's planning to pretend he never heard it!</i>

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:19.970
<b>Book's Street Corner</b>

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:23.640
Yoohoo, Amami!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.630
A-Amamiya-kun.

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:29.020
H-Hello.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:35.610
Hey, hey! Amami, what kind of cospl—

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:40.560
What is she doing?

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:45.900
<i>Conversation, conversation...</i>

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:50.960
Oh, Amamiya-kun, 
did you already use your wish?

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.310
Oh, yes.

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:55.920
You did? What did you wish for?

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:59.630
Hmm, sorry, that's a little...

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:00.970
Hmm?

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.800
Oh, sorry.

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:04.680
If you don't want to talk 
about it, that's fine.

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:06.910
Sorry.

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:10.310
Sorry for asking a weird question.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:11.320
It's fine.

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:16.880
By the way, I wished for my family 
to die with smiles on their faces.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:18.080
Oh?

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:20.040
That's kind of scary.

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:23.220
Everyone's power is!

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:27.900
Everyone's power! I won't waste it!

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:30.270
Magical...

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:33.330
Pudding Knife!

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:36.690
<i>Pudding Knife!</i>

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:39.090
<i>Pudding Knife!</i>

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:41.110
I see.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:42.460
So that's a movie.

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.550
I want to see the ocean next.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.910
Go and see it if you want to go.

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:50.020
Why are you having me guide 
you around, Maimakterion?

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:53.120
Because I want a human's commentary.

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:55.230
I wanted commentary for the movie too.

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:57.440
No way we could talk while watching it.

00:11:57.440 --> 00:12:00.690
Still, you're very good 
at disguising yourself.

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:03.360
Why disguise yourself as a human?

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.570
If you stayed as a golem, no one would 
see you and you could have gone in.

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:08.780
I wouldn't be able to use the seats.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:10.590
You could stand and watch.

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:12.510
It's a matter of feelings.

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:14.620
Golems have emotions, too.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.820
Doesn't look that way to me.

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:19.940
Haven't you noticed it 
in your battles so far?

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:22.930
Then what did you think 
of watching the movie?

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:23.860
Nothing.

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:27.070
I can't sympathize with 
this concept of camaraderie.

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:31.060
I've never cared when any 
other golem was defeated.

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:33.350
I'm not interested 
in their effort or victory.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:35.600
Yet you say you have emotions.

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:36.440
I do.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.340
I have a desire to learn more.

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:43.200
The ability to transform only proves useful 
in battle when paired with knowledge.

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:47.010
After all, my real form is just a big bun.

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:50.240
I can't lift hand nor foot 
against anyone in that state.

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:52.370
You're pretty sincere.

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:56.160
Do you not flock with other humans your age?

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:56.970
No.

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:58.360
Do you not have any friends?

00:12:58.360 --> 00:12:59.340
Shut up.

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:03.040
You don't have much of a sense 
of camaraderie for a human.

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:04.390
Just like me.

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:07.330
Hm? Is that what a sense of camaraderie is?

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:08.830
Don't lump me in with you.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:14.910
You're not going home?

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:15.860
No.

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:17.870
You should go back to the mountain.

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:20.020
I can't read books on the mountain at night.

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.450
If you don't want to go home,

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:25.490
would you, perhaps, like to swap 
places with me for a night?

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:26.700
Wha?!

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:29.660
I want to see a human home 
and lifestyle in person.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:34.550
No, I guess your family 
would see through me.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:38.040
It seems like people close 
to someone have that ability.

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.990
No, my family won't see through it.

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:43.300
Go ahead and try.

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:45.660
Really? Then, I will.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:59.770
Sorry you had to do that for Maimakterion.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.210
It's nothing.

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:04.070
I brought you a sleeping bag as a present.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:04.990
Later.

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:10.420
<i>It's still early,</i>

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:12.650
<i>but there's nothing else to do, 
so I guess I'll sleep.</i>

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.400
Wow.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.510
Ramen Supreme King

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.510
<b>Supreme King</b>

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.280
Thank you, come again.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:29.730
We didn't run into anyone today.

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:31.410
We don't run into the others that often.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:37.330
Still, you didn't tell Hakudou 
about your wish, huh?

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:40.480
That wasn't because it was 
Hakudou-san or anything.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:44.190
Then were Taiyou and Yukimachi special?

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:49.890
From their perspective, 
I probably seem like an adult.

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:52.710
I have to act properly.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:01.210
I pray everything gets destroyed soon.

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:05.500
Soon that will grant your wish.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:06.660
Wha?!

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.190
Hey.

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:12.900
I didn't mention it during 
the initial explanation,

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:17.140
but the Knights have never 
once beat this mage.

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:19.600
Let's join the stronger side.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:25.720
The last Owl Knight became 
my ally, too, you know.

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:28.980
Now, let's destroy the world together.

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:44.080
It slightly changed shape?

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:47.880
How was it?

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:51.720
They were a little suspicious of you, right?

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.430
No? I didn't have any problems.

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:57.170
It was different than what books 
and movies depict.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:01.850
There wasn't much camaraderie 
in an actual family.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:05.810
Or was that unique to your family?

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:08.980
Who knows?

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:12.200
I only know what that family is like.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.160
Again?!

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.120
Something's different.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:26.050
Looks like they improved their offense.

00:16:26.050 --> 00:16:29.130
So if we don't fully defeat them, 
they come back stronger?

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:30.420
That's trouble.

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:32.470
Why don't we run away for now?

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:37.180
Once we're out of the way, we can 
have Donnerstag gauge their strength.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:38.560
Yes, let's do that!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:39.430
Withdraw!

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:01.500
Shimaki, what's the deal?

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:03.950
It's tough.

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:07.220
It looks like they'll push 
through, unlike before.

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:08.670
Don't lose!

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:08.670
You can do it!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:12.580
This won't work.

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:17.760
Everyone, get some distance 
and cover your ears, just in case.

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:20.000
Our ears?

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:42.000
How crude.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:44.370
<b>Several Days Later</b>

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:48.290
And there!

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.220
Guess I'll call it here.

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:54.590
Hup, hup, hup.

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:57.800
Hm? This...

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:05.180
is something I've seen before.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:09.150
Why is this huge pitfall here?

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.110
Hey, Takkun.

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:12.970
Shinonome-san?!

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:14.570
T-Takkun?

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:16.780
You're Taiyou, so Takkun.

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:20.700
Hohoo.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:24.760
Shinonome, what are you doing 
this deep in the mountains?

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:26.450
Training.

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:28.770
What about you two? Why are you here?

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.630
Huh?! U-Um...

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.090
<i>Whoops.</i>

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:36.210
T-Training.

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:38.170
Huh? Training?

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:42.890
<i>How could I use such a shady lie, 
even if he caught me off guard?!</i>

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:46.420
What an admirable young boy!

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:49.310
All right! I'll help you out 
with your training!

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:50.810
<i>He believed it?!</i>

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:50.810
Hoo!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:53.610
I often came to the mountains 
when I was young, too.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:54.940
To train.

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:57.990
<i>Right, this guy's an idiot.</i>

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.450
Ramen Supreme King

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.450
<b>Supreme King</b>

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:04.410
Welcome!

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:05.490
Oh.

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:06.410
Oh.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.720
Hello, Amamiya-san.

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:09.840
Hello.

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:11.750
Hey. We run into each other a lot.

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.250
That was good!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.590
I'm full.

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:20.300
Do you two have some free time after this?

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:25.420
Ahh, I ran lots and lots!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:31.510
Running a lap around 
the mountains is just insane!

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:32.940
That was crazy.

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:35.160
All right, time to finish up!

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:36.910
Wh-What else are we doing?

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:39.970
The final step of training 
is rewarding yourself!

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:40.910
Let's go drinking!

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.900
Huh? Drinking?

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:48.000
Um, this is...

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:50.790
It looks like an apartment, but it's a bar.

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:52.570
Hoo.

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:53.000
Hey, Yuu-kun!

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:57.920
Oh, a criminal.

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.620
I'm not!

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:03.240
My eyes were linked to my mouth.

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:04.300
Jeez.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:06.280
We came by to pick this up.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:06.800
<b>The Furious Ocean,
a Biography!!</b>

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:06.800
<b>Akitani
Inatika</b>

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:08.770
What's that?

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:10.930
A diary written by Master.

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:12.650
I found it in the mountains,

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:14.810
but I thought you two should have it.

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:16.980
Have a seat, Akane-kun.

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:20.150
Sure. Pardon me, then.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:22.630
Why are you here, Akane-kun?

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:25.280
You look kind of ragged, too.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:29.150
This guy fell into a hole 
out in the mountains.

00:20:29.150 --> 00:20:30.120
Thanks.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.960
I see. Sorry.

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:36.120
Why are you apologizing, Amamiya-san?

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:39.580
All right, so let's get this party started!

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:41.510
We've got plenty of juice, too!

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:43.780
So you did come to drink after all.

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:49.960
So then, yeah, the other day, 
I went shopping and I fell...

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:51.210
Were you okay?

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:51.950
It's so noisy.

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:54.530
I strained myself from training too much.

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:54.060
Is it good?

00:20:54.530 --> 00:20:55.910
Be more careful!

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:56.300
Yeah.

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:57.650
You two be careful, too.

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:57.650
More!

00:20:57.650 --> 00:20:59.030
Thanks for having us!

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:00.060
Thanks!

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:02.030
See you later!

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:06.160
Akane-kun.

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:09.300
If you'd like, take this.

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:11.430
Huh? But that's...

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:12.820
We already...

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:15.540
...received everything Master had to give.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:17.590
Thank you.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:20.210
Well, we're heading home by bike.

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:22.230
You don't need to worry about seeing us off.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:24.920
Sure. Be careful then.

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:28.670
Which way is your place?

00:21:29.090 --> 00:21:30.350
That way.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:32.730
Sorry for keeping you out so late.

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:34.430
No, it's fine.

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:36.800
My parents don't worry about me.

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:40.020
There's no parent who doesn't 
worry about their kid.

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:42.210
That's not tr-

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:45.760
Taiyou, I'm here to get you.

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:48.200
Dad?

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:50.260
See? Told you that's not true.

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:50.910
Hello.

00:21:51.630 --> 00:21:55.120
Thank you so much for escorting my son home.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:57.890
It's nothing. I'll be going now, then.

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:09.310
Don't ever do that again!

00:22:11.270 --> 00:22:13.780
I was just trying to be nice.

00:22:13.780 --> 00:22:15.060
What's that book?

00:22:16.070 --> 00:22:17.310
Someone gave it to me.

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:18.770
I want to read it.

00:22:18.770 --> 00:22:19.840
Sometime later.

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:22.180
You're kind of dirty.

00:22:22.180 --> 00:22:23.670
What did you do today?

00:22:24.210 --> 00:22:25.450
Nothing much.

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:28.220
It was just a little busy.

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:29.680
You?

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:31.220
I...

00:22:31.220 --> 00:22:32.240
Well...

00:22:32.690 --> 00:22:34.770
Your home is a nice place.

00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:36.570
No one ever talks to me.

00:22:37.890 --> 00:22:40.170
That so?

00:22:41.770 --> 00:22:42.610
Taiyou.

00:22:43.150 --> 00:22:44.340
What?

00:22:45.060 --> 00:22:48.010
I hope the hammer falls soon.

00:22:48.820 --> 00:22:49.820
Yeah.

00:24:22.390 --> 00:24:26.900
<b>Next Episode: 
The Hero and the Children</b>
